## Shared 2×2 Hermitian parameterizations

Several apparently unrelated coordinate systems can be written as 2×2
Hermitian matrices:

1. **Minkowski Spacetime** (Twistor theory):
   X = t·I + x·σ₁ + y·σ₂ + z·σ₃ = [t+z   x−iy]
